sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Handler
    participant S as redis.Store
    participant P as Other writer
    C->>H: GET /events/x?offset=now&live=long-poll
    Note over H: handleRead · parse offset + cursor
    H->>S: SUBSCRIBE ds:notify and confirm
    H->>S: ReadPage · one logical access + typed root snapshot
    S-->>H: empty page · caller is at the tail
    Note over H,S: subscription before atomic page closes the attach race
    P->>S: POST append → append.lua PUBLISH 'a'
    S-->>H: wake
    H->>S: ReadPage NoTouch · final authoritative snapshot
    loop bounded pages to that tail
        S-->>H: frame-aligned page
        H-->>C: write page and flush
    end
    Note over H,S: no immediate attach reread · no producer read · timeout returns a final no-touch page with 204
